        "faq_sizing": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which size should I order?",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "content": "<p>Foot-worn items are sized to your usual shoe size — if you are between sizes or wear a wide fit, size up. Calf, knee and ankle items are sized by measuring around the limb at its widest point, not by shoe size; the measurement range for each size is on this page. Still unsure? Email us your measurements and we'll tell you which to pick.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_fit": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I wear it with shoes?",
            "icon": "shoe",
            "content": "<p>It depends on the item. Insoles, socks, sleeves and toe spacers are cut to sit inside everyday closed shoes. Braces, splints and night-time items are shaped to be worn on their own, and massagers and stretching aids are used out of shoes altogether. The product description above says which applies here — and if it is not clear, email us before you order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does shipping take?",
            "icon": "truck",
            "content": "<p>Delivery times vary by item, so we don't quote a single window. You'll get a tracking link by email as soon as your order ships, and you can follow it the whole way. Shipping is free on US orders over $50.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_pre_order": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Not sure which one to order?",
            "icon": "chat_bubble",
            "content": "<p>Email us before you order. Tell us your shoe size or what you're looking for and we'll tell you which option fits — it's much easier than guessing and sending something back.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_care": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I clean it?",
            "icon": "washing",
            "content": "<p>Fabric items — socks, sleeves, braces and straps — hand wash in cool water with a mild detergent and air dry away from direct heat. Do not machine dry. Silicone and gel items rinse clean with soap and water.</p><p><strong>Never immerse an electrical item in water.</strong> Unplug it first and wipe it with a damp cloth only. Always follow the care instructions supplied with the product, which take precedence over this note.</p>"
          }
        },
